    "['ipv4 adjacency local-ip-addr [parameter1] remote-ip-addr [parameter2] sid [parameter3]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols source-packet-routing source-routing-path sr-adjacency-10.1.1.2-to-10.1.1.1 from 10.1.1.2 to 10.1.1.1 sid 330221', 'parent_command': ['set system host-name [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set system host-name [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent Juniper configuration command for the given Huawei segment routing adjacency SID configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing source-routing-path sr-adjacency-10.1.1.2-to-10.1.1.1 from 10.1.1.2 to 10.1.1.1 sid 330221\\n##\\n\\nThis Juniper command:\\n1. Creates an SR adjacency between local address 10.1.1.2 and remote address 10.1.1.1\\n2. Assigns the same SID value 330221\\n3. Uses Juniper\\'s source packet routing syntax where the adjacency is named descriptively (\"sr-adjacency-10.1.1.2-to-10.1.1.1\")', 'trans_template': 'set protocols source-packet-routing source-routing-path sr-adjacency-10.1.1.2-to-10.1.1.1 from 10.1.1.2 to 10.1.1.1 sid 330221'}]]": 1,
    "['ipv4 adjacency local-ip-addr [parameter1] remote-ip-addr [parameter2] sid [parameter3]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols source-packet-routing source-routing-path \"10.2.1.1-10.2.1.2\" to 10.2.1.2 from 10.2.1.1 sid 330120', 'parent_command': ['set system host-name [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set system host-name [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing source-routing-path \"10.2.1.1-10.2.1.2\" to 10.2.1.2 from 10.2.1.1 sid 330120\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. In Juniper, segment routing adjacency SIDs are configured under `protocols source-packet-routing` hierarchy\\n2. The adjacency is defined as a \"source-routing-path\" with a descriptive name (I used the IP addresses here)\\n3. The `to` parameter specifies the remote IP address\\n4. The `from` parameter specifies the local IP address\\n5. The SID value (330120) is specified at the end\\n6. This creates an equivalent adjacency SID mapping as the Huawei configuration', 'trans_template': 'set protocols source-packet-routing source-routing-path \"10.2.1.1-10.2.1.2\" to 10.2.1.2 from 10.2.1.1 sid 330120'}]]": 1,
